<title>USA: Heartland Express Inc Q4 net rises.</title>
<headline>Heartland Express Inc Q4 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>CORALVILLE, Iowa 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three Months Ended December 31:	1996	    1995</p>
<p> Revenues			     $57,086,505    $49,421,840</p>
<p> Net Income			     6,280,001	5,125,835</p>
<p> Earnings per share			  0.21	     0.17</p>
<p>Average number of shares</p>
<p>  outstanding			  30,000,000     30,039,210</p>
<p> Year Ended December 31:		  1996	    1995</p>
<p> Revenues			    $229,011,108   $191,506,741</p>
<p> Net Income			    25,030,491     20,585,474</p>
<p> Earnings per share			  0.83	     0.69</p>
<p>Average number of shares</p>
<p>  outstanding			  30,000,000     30,039,210</p>
<p>NOTE: The company said it paid a 50 percent stock dividend on October 4, 1996, which is reflected in the results.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
</text>
